-# The three art states of a badge in one place, so no screen has to re-derive
-# them: an uploaded image, one of the preset glyphs, or neither.
-#
-# Mirrors ranks/_art and items/_art. A badge shows its art in four places
-# (card front, mini card, form preview, award row), so the branch has never
-# belonged to any one of them.
- if badge.upload?
  = image_tag badge.icon, alt: ''
- elsif (glyph = gh_glyph(badge.icon_glyph))
  = glyph
- else
  %i.fa-solid.fa-award{ 'aria-hidden': 'true' }
